{"seq":1,"slug":"stress-and-strain","title":"应力与应变：材料力学的基本语言","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mechanics/mechanics-of-materials/stress-and-strain","wordCount":1295,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"应力与应变-材料力学的基本语言\">应力与应变：材料力学的基本语言</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>应力和应变是材料力学的两个核心概念，几乎所有后续内容都建立在它们之上。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>应力</strong>：单位面积上的内力。正应力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = \\dfrac{N}{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（拉压，垂直于截面），切应力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = \\dfrac{Q}{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（剪切，平行于截面）。单位是帕斯卡 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Pa</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>N/m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Pa} = \\text{N/m}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pa</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，工程上常用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPa</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>应变</strong>：单位长度上的变形。线应变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon = \\dfrac{\\Delta L}{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（无量纲），切应变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>（角度变化）。</li>\n<li><strong>胡克定律</strong>：弹性范围内应力与应变成正比，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = E\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是弹性模量（杨氏模量）。</li>\n<li><strong>泊松比</strong>：材料纵向拉伸时横向会收缩，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msub><mi>ε</mi><mtext>横</mtext></msub><msub><mi>ε</mi><mtext>纵</mtext></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu = -\\dfrac{\\varepsilon_{\\text{横}}}{\\varepsilon_{\\text{纵}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">纵</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">横</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，大多数金属约 0.3。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><p>我一开始分不清&quot;力&quot;和&quot;应力&quot;有什么区别。后来想通了一个生活例子：同样用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext> N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\text{ N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> N</span></span></span></span></span></span> 拉一根粗钢丝和一根细钢丝，细的更容易断。力一样，但细钢丝截面小，单位面积承受的内力更大——这个&quot;单位面积的内力&quot;就是应力。所以<strong>应力才是判断材料会不会坏的真正指标，而不是力</strong>。</p>\n<p>应力为什么要除以面积？因为材料的破坏是局部的：哪一点的应力超过了材料能承受的极限，哪里就先坏。把力摊到面积上，才能和材料本身的强度指标（如屈服强度、抗拉强度）直接比较。</p>\n<p>理解材料行为的钥匙是<strong>应力—应变曲线</strong>。以低碳钢拉伸为例，它的曲线分几个阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    O[原点] --&gt; A[弹性阶段 线性]&#10;    A --&gt; B[屈服阶段 应力几乎不变 应变猛增]&#10;    B --&gt; C[强化阶段 重新承力]&#10;    C --&gt; D[颈缩阶段 局部变细]&#10;    D --&gt; E[断裂]\">flowchart LR\n    O[原点] --&gt; A[弹性阶段 线性]\n    A --&gt; B[屈服阶段 应力几乎不变 应变猛增]\n    B --&gt; C[强化阶段 重新承力]\n    C --&gt; D[颈缩阶段 局部变细]\n    D --&gt; E[断裂]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>弹性阶段</strong>：卸载后能完全恢复，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = E\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 成立。斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 越大材料越&quot;硬&quot;（不易变形）。</li>\n<li><strong>屈服</strong>：应力达到屈服强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后，材料像&quot;软&quot;了一样，应力不增而应变剧增。工程上通常以屈服当作&quot;失效&quot;，因为产生了不可恢复的塑性变形。</li>\n<li><strong>强化与颈缩</strong>：继续拉，材料重新承力，直到某处局部变细（颈缩）最终断裂。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不同材料的曲线形状差别巨大，这决定了它们的用途：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材料</th>\n<th>弹性模量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>行为特征</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低碳钢</td>\n<td>~200 GPa</td>\n<td>塑性好，断前有明显屈服和颈缩</td>\n<td>结构钢、钢筋</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铸铁</td>\n<td>~120 GPa</td>\n<td>脆性，几乎无屈服直接断</td>\n<td>机床床身、管件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铝合金</td>\n<td>~70 GPa</td>\n<td>轻、塑性中等</td>\n<td>航空结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混凝土</td>\n<td>~30 GPa</td>\n<td>抗压强抗拉弱</td>\n<td>受压构件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表解释了很多工程直觉:为什么钢筋混凝土要把钢筋放在受拉一侧——因为混凝土抗拉差，让钢筋专门承担拉应力。</p>\n<p><strong>泊松效应</strong>也很有意思:你拉一根橡皮筋，它会变细;压一块橡皮，它会鼓出来。这种&quot;纵向变形引起横向变形&quot;的现象用泊松比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 描述。它在三维应力分析里至关重要，因为一个方向的应力会通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 影响其他方向的应变。</p>\n<p>胡克定律的三维推广(广义胡克定律)正是基于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 两个常数，把六个应力分量和六个应变分量联系起来，这是弹性力学和有限元计算的出发点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一根直径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\text{ mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> mm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的钢杆受 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mtext> kN</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\text{ kN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> kN</span></span></span></span></span></span> 拉力。求杆内正应力。若钢的屈服强度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>235</mn><mtext> MPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">235\\text{ MPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">235</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> MPa</span></span></span></span></span></span>,它安全吗?(提示:先算截面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\pi d^2/4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/4</span></span></span></span></span>。)</li>\n<li>同一根杆原长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{ m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m</span></span></span></span></span></span>,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext> GPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = 200\\text{ GPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> GPa</span></span></span></span></span></span>,在上题载荷下伸长多少?(提示:由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = E\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 先求应变。)</li>\n<li>思考:为什么玻璃和铸铁这类脆性材料，我们更关心它的抗拉强度而不是屈服强度?它们的应力—应变曲线缺了哪个阶段?</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>材料的应力—应变数据是所有工程设计的基础。现代材料数据库(如 MatWeb)收录了成千上万种材料的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 等参数，工程师在仿真前先从中选材。增材制造(3D 打印)兴起后，人们甚至能设计&quot;超材料&quot;——通过微观结构让宏观泊松比变成负值(拉伸时反而变胖),用于减震和柔性器件。</p>\n<p>复合材料(如碳纤维)打破了&quot;各向同性&quot;假设:它在纤维方向和垂直方向的弹性模量天差地别。这让应力分析从一个标量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 变成一个矩阵，也是航空航天结构设计里最有挑战性的部分之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>应力=单位面积内力，是判断材料是否破坏的真正指标;应变=单位长度变形。</li>\n<li>胡克定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = E\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 只在弹性阶段成立;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 衡量材料的硬度。</li>\n<li>应力—应变曲线的形状决定材料是塑性还是脆性，进而决定用途。</li>\n<li>泊松比刻画横向收缩，是三维应力分析的关键参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>掌握了这套语言，下一篇我们就能分析工程里最常见的构件——受弯的梁。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应力与应变：材料力学的基本语言","id":"应力与应变-材料力学的基本语言"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动力学：力、能量与守恒","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mechanics/theoretical-mechanics/dynamics-and-energy"},"next":{"title":"梁的弯曲","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mechanics/mechanics-of-materials/beam-bending"}}